#: src/rising-welcome:111
#, python-brace-format
msgid "[ {name} ]"
msgstr "[ {name} ]"

#: src/rising-welcome:180
msgid "Rendimiento puro. Libertad total. Powered by Debian"
msgstr "Pure performance. Total freedom. Powered by Debian"

#: src/rising-welcome:190
msgid ""
"Gracias por instalar RisingOS. Esperamos que disfrutes esta experiencia y "
"para eso este es un tour guiado por tu nuevo sistema, para mostrarte todo lo "
"que tenés disponible."
msgstr ""
"Thanks for installing RisingOS. We hope you enjoy the experience, and "
"that's what this is for: a guided tour of your new system, to show you "
"everything you have available."

#: src/rising-welcome:220
msgid "Conectado a internet"
msgstr "Connected to the internet"

#: src/rising-welcome:225
msgid "Sin conexión — algunas funciones no estarán disponibles"
msgstr "No connection — some features won't be available"

#: src/rising-welcome:248 src/rising-welcome:320
msgid "↓  Actualizar ahora"
msgstr "↓  Update now"

#: src/rising-welcome:250
msgid "Sin conexión — no disponible"
msgstr "No connection — not available"

#: src/rising-welcome:252
msgid "Conectate a internet para actualizar el sistema."
msgstr "Connect to the internet to update the system."

#: src/rising-welcome:256
msgid "PASO 2 — SISTEMA"
msgstr "STEP 2 — SYSTEM"

#: src/rising-welcome:257
msgid ""
"Actualizaciones\n"
"del sistema"
msgstr ""
"System\n"
"updates"

#: src/rising-welcome:258
msgid ""
"Antes de empezar, asegurate de tener el sistema al día. Un sistema "
"actualizado es más seguro, más estable y aprovecha mejor tu hardware."
msgstr ""
"Before you start, make sure your system is up to date. An updated system "
"is more secure, more stable, and makes better use of your hardware."

#: src/rising-welcome:302
msgid "● Salida del sistema en tiempo real"
msgstr "● Live system output"

#: src/rising-welcome:388
msgid "Actualizando..."
msgstr "Updating..."

#: src/rising-welcome:410
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Error: {error}\n"
msgstr "Error: {error}\n"

#: src/rising-welcome:418
msgid "✓  Sistema actualizado"
msgstr "✓  System updated"

#: src/rising-welcome:421
msgid "Tu sistema está al día."
msgstr "Your system is up to date."

#: src/rising-welcome:424
msgid "Reintentar"
msgstr "Retry"

#: src/rising-welcome:426
msgid "Ocurrió un error. Podés intentarlo más tarde."
msgstr "An error occurred. You can try again later."

#: src/rising-welcome:444
msgid "Menú de aplicaciones"
msgstr "Applications menu"

#: src/rising-welcome:445
msgid ""
"Hacé clic en el logo de RisingOS abajo a la izquierda para buscar y abrir "
"cualquier programa."
msgstr ""
"Click the RisingOS logo at the bottom left to search for and open any "
"program."

#: src/rising-welcome:447
msgid "Barra de tareas"
msgstr "Taskbar"

#: src/rising-welcome:448
msgid ""
"Cada ventana abierta aparece en la barra inferior. Hacé clic para cambiar "
"entre ellas."
msgstr ""
"Every open window appears on the bottom bar. Click to switch between them."

#: src/rising-welcome:450
msgid "Área de notificaciones"
msgstr "Notification area"

#: src/rising-welcome:451
msgid ""
"En la esquina inferior derecha encontrás el reloj, el volumen, la red y las "
"notificaciones del sistema."
msgstr ""
"In the bottom right corner you'll find the clock, volume, network, and "
"system notifications."

#: src/rising-welcome:481
msgid "Abrir gestor de archivos"
msgstr "Open file manager"

#: src/rising-welcome:486
msgid "PASO 3 — TOUR"
msgstr "STEP 3 — TOUR"

#: src/rising-welcome:487
msgid ""
"Tu nuevo\n"
"escritorio"
msgstr ""
"Your new\n"
"desktop"

#: src/rising-welcome:489
msgid ""
"RisingOS usa el entorno XFCE: rápido, liviano y completamente configurable. "
"En 30 segundos lo conocés."
msgstr ""
"RisingOS uses the XFCE desktop environment: fast, lightweight, and fully "
"configurable. You'll get the hang of it in 30 seconds."

#: src/rising-welcome:514
msgid "⚙  Abrir configuración del sistema"
msgstr "⚙  Open system settings"

#: src/rising-welcome:520
msgid ""
"💡  También podés hacer clic derecho sobre el escritorio para cambiar el "
"fondo de pantalla."
msgstr ""
"💡  You can also right-click on the desktop to change the wallpaper."

#: src/rising-welcome:529
msgid "PASO 4 — PERSONALIZACIÓN"
msgstr "STEP 4 — CUSTOMIZATION"

#: src/rising-welcome:530
msgid "Hacelo tuyo"
msgstr "Make it yours"

#: src/rising-welcome:532
msgid ""
"Cambiá el tema de escritorio, los íconos, los colores de las ventanas y los "
"fondos de pantalla. Configurá el panel a tu gusto: podés ajustar su posición "
"y agregar o quitar widgets. El control es total."
msgstr ""
"Change the desktop theme, icons, window colors, and wallpapers. Set up the "
"panel your way: adjust its position and add or remove widgets. You're in "
"full control."

#: src/rising-welcome:555
msgid "Navegador web Firefox"
msgstr "Firefox web browser"

#: src/rising-welcome:556
msgid "Gestor de correo electrónico Thunderbird"
msgstr "Thunderbird email client"

#: src/rising-welcome:557
msgid "Explorador de archivos Thunar"
msgstr "Thunar file explorer"

#: src/rising-welcome:558
msgid "Suite de oficina LibreOffice completa"
msgstr "Full LibreOffice office suite"

#: src/rising-welcome:559
msgid "Reproductor multimedia VLC"
msgstr "VLC media player"

#: src/rising-welcome:581
msgid "Abrir Centro de Software"
msgstr "Open Software Center"

#: src/rising-welcome:586
msgid "PASO 5 — APLICACIONES"
msgstr "STEP 5 — APPLICATIONS"

#: src/rising-welcome:587
msgid ""
"Ya tenés todo\n"
"para trabajar"
msgstr ""
"Everything you\n"
"need is ready"

#: src/rising-welcome:589
msgid "RisingOS viene con software básico listo para usar:"
msgstr "RisingOS comes with essential software ready to use:"

#: src/rising-welcome:593
msgid ""
"Y si necesitás más, desde el Centro de Software podés instalar miles de "
"programas."
msgstr ""
"And if you need more, the Software Center lets you install thousands of "
"programs."

#: src/rising-welcome:619
msgid "Requisitos mínimos recomendados:"
msgstr "Recommended minimum requirements:"

#: src/rising-welcome:625
msgid "CPU    4 núcleos"
msgstr "CPU    4 cores"

#: src/rising-welcome:626
msgid "RAM    8 GB"
msgstr "RAM    8 GB"

#: src/rising-welcome:627
msgid "Disco  10 GB libres"
msgstr "Disk   10 GB free"

#: src/rising-welcome:628
msgid "GPU    Opcional (NVIDIA mejora rendimiento)"
msgstr "GPU    Optional (NVIDIA improves performance)"

#: src/rising-welcome:638
msgid "✦  Abrir Rising IA"
msgstr "✦  Open Rising IA"

#: src/rising-welcome:643
msgid "PASO 6 — INTELIGENCIA ARTIFICIAL"
msgstr "STEP 6 — ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE"

#: src/rising-welcome:644
msgid ""
"IA local,\n"
"en tu máquina."
msgstr ""
"Local AI,\n"
"on your machine."

#: src/rising-welcome:646
msgid ""
"Rising IA es tu asistente para instalar de forma automatizada tu propia IA "
"local. Funciona sin internet, sin suscripciones y con privacidad total.\n"
"\n"
"Rising IA instala y configura Ollama + Open WebUI, dejándote elegir el "
"modelo que mejor se adapte a tu equipo. Si detecta una GPU NVIDIA, te ofrece "
"instalar el driver propietario para un mejor rendimiento."
msgstr ""
"Rising IA is your assistant for automatically installing your own local "
"AI. It works without internet, without subscriptions, and with full "
"privacy.\n"
"\n"
"Rising IA installs and configures Ollama + Open WebUI, letting you choose "
"the model that best fits your hardware. If it detects an NVIDIA GPU, it "
"offers to install the proprietary driver for better performance."

#: src/rising-welcome:680
msgid "Rendimiento puro. Libertad total."
msgstr "Pure performance. Total freedom."

#: src/rising-welcome:689
msgid "Comunidad · Foro de soporte"
msgstr "Community · Support forum"

#: src/rising-welcome:698
msgid "No mostrar esta guía al iniciar sesión"
msgstr "Don't show this guide at login"

#: src/rising-welcome:705
msgid "💿  Instalar RisingOS"
msgstr "💿  Install RisingOS"

#: src/rising-welcome:713
msgid ""
"¡Todo listo\n"
"para empezar!"
msgstr ""
"All set,\n"
"ready to go!"

#: src/rising-welcome:715
msgid ""
"Tu sistema está configurado y listo para usar. Podés volver a esta guía "
"cuando quieras desde el menú de inicio → Bienvenida a RisingOS."
msgstr ""
"Your system is configured and ready to use. You can come back to this "
"guide anytime from the start menu → Welcome to RisingOS."

#: src/rising-welcome:742
msgid ""
"Hecho con ❤ en Salta, Argentina\n"
"Rising Arrow · Francisco Galaso"
msgstr ""
"Made with ❤ in Salta, Argentina\n"
"Rising Arrow · Francisco Galaso"

#: src/rising-welcome:773
msgid "Bienvenido a RisingOS"
msgstr "Welcome to RisingOS"

#: src/rising-welcome:808
msgid "← Anterior"
msgstr "← Back"

#: src/rising-welcome:832 src/rising-welcome:852
msgid "Siguiente →"
msgstr "Next →"

#: src/rising-welcome:852
msgid "Cerrar  ✓"
msgstr "Close  ✓"

#: src/rising-welcome:853
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{current} / {total}"
msgstr "{current} / {total}"
